  "goodToKnow": "Neuartig means novel or of a new kind: ein neuartiges Material, eine neuartige Therapie, and in early 2020, das neuartige Coronavirus. It stresses that something is a completely new type, not just new. Die Art means kind or type: eine Art Suppe (a kind of soup). Similar: andersartig (different in kind), einzigartig (unique), großartig (great)."
